option "operating_currency" "USD"

2026-01-01 open Equity:Opening-Balances
2026-01-01 open Assets:Checking                USD
2026-01-01 open Expenses:Food:Groceries        USD
2026-01-01 open Expenses:Misc:Other            USD

; Groceries is mapped normally...
2026-01-01 custom "envelope" "map" "Expenses:Food:Groceries" "Groceries"
2026-01-01 custom "envelope" "allocate" "Groceries" 200.00 USD

; ...but Expenses:Misc:Other has no `map` directive at all, which is the
; unmapped-expense failure this fixture exists to exercise.

2026-01-01 * "Opening balance"
    Assets:Checking      500.00 USD
    Equity:Opening-Balances

2026-01-05 * "Groceries"
    Assets:Checking      -40.00 USD
    Expenses:Food:Groceries

2026-01-10 * "Something uncategorized"
    Assets:Checking      -25.00 USD
    Expenses:Misc:Other
